$$
$$
\mathfrak{S}' = \{1, \tau\} \cdot \mathfrak{S}
$$
donc
$$
1 \to \mathfrak{S} \to \mathfrak{S}' \to \{1, \tau\} \to 1 \leqno{(6)}
$$
